stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> anonymous
    anonymous --> logging_in: login o restauracion valida
    logging_in --> authenticated: respuesta valida y guardado seguro
    logging_in --> anonymous: loginFailed
    authenticated --> expired: reloj detecta expiracion al solicitar
    authenticated --> refreshing: request401
    expired --> refreshing: solicitud espera renovacion
    refreshing --> refreshing: otras solicitudes comparten el vuelo
    refreshing --> authenticated: refreshSucceeded y guardado seguro
    refreshing --> anonymous: refreshFailed
    anonymous --> closing: limpiar despues de fallo
    logging_in --> closing: logout
    authenticated --> closing: logout o segundo 401
    expired --> closing: logout
    refreshing --> closing: logout
    closing --> closing: borrado fallido o respuesta obsoleta
    closing --> anonymous: logoutCompleted tras borrar SecureStore
